  "reproduction_readme": "UID2127 独立复现资料。Windows Python3.14.3，未容器化，使用PyNaCl1.6.2 wheel同版本_sodium.pyd，所有nacl Python产品模块均从冻结replay/src导入，actual-import和runtime-support-proof可核。公开复现先按dependency-lock.stdout.log装依赖，再运行 python verification/verification/strict-container-r2/runtime_loader.py test_acceptance.py：28项24过4失败。runtime_loader.py只解析已安装wheel原生扩展，不使用wheel的Python实现；--smoke实测通过。相关pytest可从产物根运行 python verification/verification/strict-container-r2/runtime_loader.py --pytest tests/test_secretstream_container.py tests/test_secretstream.py tests/test_secret.py -q -o addopts=：独立复跑71通过。独立AD编码和push/pull使用真实libsodium；每字节截断均核零目标写入。demo保留四项失败和exit1。Windows长路径复制及后验Hash工具问题留存r1/r2说明，未改源码、未重复测试计数，实际全文件Hash核验通过。",
